00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:58,930
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

1
00:00:59,238 --> 00:01:03,976
[Apocalypse Log 5]

2
00:01:28,059 --> 00:01:29,350
Don't move.

3
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:04,725
I can remove the tape, but you have to behave.

4
00:02:04,725 --> 00:02:07,059
You don't want to attract
the zombies back here, do you?

5
00:02:17,225 --> 00:02:18,642
Why did you kidnap me?

6
00:02:18,642 --> 00:02:20,809
Where are you taking me?

7
00:02:20,809 --> 00:02:23,517
I told you, I have something important to do.

8
00:02:23,517 --> 00:02:25,973
What does that have to do with me?

9
00:02:27,725 --> 00:02:30,517
I've been looking for someone important.

10
00:02:30,517 --> 00:02:32,153
That person is you.

11
00:02:33,934 --> 00:02:36,434
We weren't even acquainted before.

12
00:02:36,434 --> 00:02:41,059
And besides, is this how
you treat someone important?

13
00:02:41,059 --> 00:02:44,475
I can't explain everything to you right now.

14
00:02:44,475 --> 00:02:46,350
I need to get you on the road
as soon as possible.

15
00:02:46,350 --> 00:02:48,142
This is the simplest and most direct method.

16
00:02:48,142 --> 00:02:50,059
Explain it to me right now.

17
00:02:50,059 --> 00:02:53,609
If you don't explain it,
we're staying right here.

18
00:02:57,600 --> 00:03:01,600
I'm looking for you because you're an immune.

19
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:04,129
You have the gene that makes you
immune to the zombie virus.

20
00:03:05,333 --> 00:03:07,100
Immune?

21
00:03:07,100 --> 00:03:08,559
Are you kidding me?

22
00:03:08,559 --> 00:03:10,415
How do you know that?

23
00:03:20,892 --> 00:03:24,500
Well, did you bite yourself here?

24
00:03:31,017 --> 00:03:32,922
- Guang Qi.
<i>- I'm here.</i>

25
00:03:32,922 --> 00:03:35,809
Detect if the target is an immune.

26
00:03:35,809 --> 00:03:38,480
<i>Target confirmed as an immune.</i>

27
00:03:42,042 --> 00:03:44,094
Haven't you ever wondered

28
00:03:44,094 --> 00:03:47,098
why you didn't turn
into a zombie after being bitten?

29
00:03:49,875 --> 00:03:53,809
So, you saved me just because I'm an immune?

30
00:03:53,809 --> 00:03:56,492
Then why didn't you just take me then?

31
00:03:57,809 --> 00:04:00,004
I had to wait for your wound to heal.

32
00:04:03,309 --> 00:04:07,100
Traveling with an injured person
is too much of a burden, huh?

33
00:04:23,267 --> 00:04:25,225
You bastard.

34
00:04:26,333 --> 00:04:29,483
And here I was, trusting you
and thinking we were friends.

35
00:04:31,059 --> 00:04:32,434
What about the others?

36
00:04:32,434 --> 00:04:34,574
What did you do to them?

37
00:04:37,934 --> 00:04:40,490
I had no reason to harm them.

38
00:04:42,267 --> 00:04:46,055
I left a note saying you and I
went out to pick wild fruit.

39
00:04:49,392 --> 00:04:51,475
I've said all I need to say.

40
00:04:51,475 --> 00:04:55,392
Since you're awake now, be wise and follow me.

41
00:04:55,392 --> 00:04:58,017
There will be many dangers on this trip.

42
00:04:58,017 --> 00:04:59,600
Even though you're an immune,

43
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:02,624
you still won't survive
being torn apart by zombies.

44
00:05:05,267 --> 00:05:08,142
Don't go looking for unnecessary trouble.

45
00:05:15,409 --> 00:05:16,997
Untie my hands.

46
00:05:18,017 --> 00:05:19,475
No.

47
00:05:19,475 --> 00:05:20,850
I need to take a piss.

48
00:05:20,850 --> 00:05:23,737
Are you not even going to
let me relieve myself?

49
00:06:31,017 --> 00:06:32,517
Let go of me, you jerk!

50
00:06:32,517 --> 00:06:34,156
Still trying to run?

51
00:06:41,684 --> 00:06:43,517
No, I'm done running.

52
00:06:47,208 --> 00:06:50,610
If there's a next time, I won't be so polite.

53
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,511
You go first.

54
00:07:14,184 --> 00:07:15,934
What are you up to now?

55
00:07:16,642 --> 00:07:19,292
You're tying me up and
walking me like a dog?

56
00:07:19,292 --> 00:07:20,809
Get in front.

57
00:08:09,083 --> 00:08:10,088
Hey.

58
00:08:10,088 --> 00:08:12,047
Who exactly sent you?

59
00:08:14,158 --> 00:08:16,199
You're looking for an immune?

60
00:08:16,199 --> 00:08:18,657
Your organization must be powerful.

61
00:08:18,657 --> 00:08:19,700
If they're so powerful,

62
00:08:19,700 --> 00:08:21,991
why didn't they send a helicopter?

63
00:08:21,991 --> 00:08:24,408
If you don't want to walk, I can carry you.

64
00:08:24,408 --> 00:08:25,741
But I'll have to tape your mouth shut,

65
00:08:25,741 --> 00:08:27,501
so you don't vomit all over me.

66
00:08:28,449 --> 00:08:32,002
Did you lose contact with your organization?

67
00:08:37,241 --> 00:08:39,283
How much longer do we have to walk?

68
00:08:39,283 --> 00:08:41,033
We can't just keep walking like this.

69
00:08:41,033 --> 00:08:43,699
Even in Journey to the West, they had a horse.

70
00:08:43,699 --> 00:08:45,533
We cross Mount Qianlong first.

71
00:08:45,533 --> 00:08:47,158
My car is parked on the other side.

72
00:08:48,875 --> 00:08:50,833
So, who exactly are you?

73
00:08:50,833 --> 00:08:52,166
A mercenary?

74
00:08:52,166 --> 00:08:53,250
A bounty hunter?

75
00:08:53,250 --> 00:08:55,012
Or something else?

76
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:00,542
Who is looking for me?

77
00:09:00,542 --> 00:09:03,708
I have the right to know that much.

78
00:09:03,708 --> 00:09:06,369
You'll find out when we get there.

79
00:09:08,006 --> 00:09:09,541
Stop acting so mysterious.

80
00:09:09,541 --> 00:09:11,445
I'm much better off asking a dog.

81
00:09:15,883 --> 00:09:17,550
What now?

82
00:09:17,550 --> 00:09:19,078
I need to pee.

83
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:20,967
Do it right here.

84
00:09:20,967 --> 00:09:23,609
It's an emergency. Untie me, quick.

85
00:09:28,092 --> 00:09:29,425
I'll help you.

86
00:09:32,383 --> 00:09:34,841
If you don't want to go, keep walking.

87
00:09:37,008 --> 00:09:38,610
Fine, I'll go.

88
00:10:10,925 --> 00:10:13,053
Are you really going to stare?

89
00:10:13,883 --> 00:10:15,217
Fine.

90
00:10:33,633 --> 00:10:35,925
So, you're a pervert.

91
00:10:35,925 --> 00:10:38,418
We're both men. What's the big deal?

92
00:10:39,050 --> 00:10:41,521
Then take yours off and show me.

93
00:10:51,925 --> 00:10:55,005
Fine. You win.

94
00:11:16,125 --> 00:11:18,133
Why did you stop all of a sudden?

95
00:11:18,133 --> 00:11:19,944
It's time to eat.

96
00:11:24,925 --> 00:11:27,562
I'd rather starve to death than eat your food.

97
00:11:51,375 --> 00:11:53,383
What?

98
00:11:53,383 --> 00:11:54,883
You'll just eat anything?

99
00:11:54,883 --> 00:11:56,600
What if you get poisoned?

100
00:12:03,842 --> 00:12:05,667
You're the one who will suffer anyway.

101
00:12:05,667 --> 00:12:07,957
Do whatever you want.

102
00:12:10,175 --> 00:12:12,290
I won't starve without you.

103
00:12:22,008 --> 00:12:23,645
What now?

104
00:12:27,333 --> 00:12:28,750
Lin Zai.

105
00:12:28,750 --> 00:12:30,334
What's wrong with you?

106
00:12:33,792 --> 00:12:35,578
An allergy?

107
00:13:16,208 --> 00:13:17,500
I'm sorry.

108
00:13:18,467 --> 00:13:20,068
Don't go.

109
00:13:40,842 --> 00:13:42,125
Lin Zai.

110
00:13:42,125 --> 00:13:43,533
Lin Zai.

111
00:13:43,533 --> 00:13:46,270
Hang in there. We'll get you some medicine.

112
00:17:11,239 --> 00:17:13,449
Lin Zai... Lin Zai!

113
00:17:13,449 --> 00:17:14,894
Lin Zai!

114
00:18:05,907 --> 00:18:08,996
[Shanhe Daily]

115
00:18:27,458 --> 00:18:30,045
Lin Zai, you have to hang in there.

